<title>USA: Hi-Rise president, founder to step down.</title>
<headline>Hi-Rise president, founder to step down.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hi-Rise Recycling Systems Inc said Friday that its president and founder, Mark Shantzis, will step down from supervising day-to-day operations and that Chief Executive Don Engel will assume the president's duties.</p>
<p>Hi-Rise said Shantzis will remain co-chairman of the board and serve as a company consultant.</p>
<p>The company said the move had been contemplated.</p>
</text>
